{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670892007393511706","title":"显示器基带工程师","description":"1.主板设计：协助资深工程师画原理图、核对 BOM、整理 PCB 约束,负责显示器scaler,接口电源等基础模块\n2.单板调试：新机上电、电压 / 时钟 / 复位调试,排查不开机、花屏、无声、接口异常等基础硬件问题\n3.音视频 / 接口功能验：调试 HDMI、I2S/TDM、PDM 麦克风、CI+、显示画面、显示器信号通路,保证功能正常稳定\n4.测试与整改: 配合做功能测试、可靠性测试、EMC 静电辐射整改,输出测试报告、问题复盘文档\n5.量产支持:跟进试产、解决产线简单不良,协助提升单板良率","requirement":"1.专业：电子信息、通信、自动化、微电子等理工科硕士应届生\n2.基础能力: 懂模电、数电基础；了解 I2C、SPI、I2S、PDM、DDR、HDMI 等常用接口原理,看得懂简单时序、电源电路\n3.工具: 会 AD/Cadence 任意一种画图软件、会用示波器、万用表基础调试\n4.素质:踏实细心、能接受实验室调试、简单驻厂,具备问题排查学习能力","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786018775665,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178830559051874412","name":"硬件研发类","en_name":"Hardware R\u0026D","i18n_name":"硬件研发类"},"job_id":"7670892007393380634","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_ty